 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION. PROGRAM-ID. LEADS.** A phone book that knows about sales leads.* Same shape as MEDIA - one relative file, a menu,* add / list / find - with a status code and a* packed-decimal value per contact.** The status field shows why 88 levels earn their* keep: LS-SOLD reads better than IF LR-STATUS =* "S", and the test is the same p-code either way.* ENVIRONMENT DIVISION. INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION. FILE-CONTROL.     SELECT LEAD-FILE ASSIGN TO "LEADS.DAT"         ORGANIZATION IS RELATIVE         ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC         RELATIVE KEY IS LEAD-KEY         FILE STATUS IS FILE-STAT.* DATA DIVISION. FILE SECTION. FD  LEAD-FILE. 01  LEAD-REC.     05  LR-NAME         PIC X(24).     05  LR-COMPANY      PIC X(24).     05  LR-PHONE        PIC X(14).     05  LR-STATUS       PIC X.         88  LS-LEAD     VALUE "L".         88  LS-CALLED   VALUE "C".         88  LS-SOLD     VALUE "S".     05  LR-VALUE        PIC S9(5)V99 COMP-3.* WORKING-STORAGE SECTION. 01  LEAD-KEY            PIC 9(4) COMP. 01  FILE-STAT           PIC XX.     88  STAT-OK         VALUE "00". 01  WS-CHOICE           PIC X. 01  WS-DONE             PIC X VALUE "N".     88  ALL-DONE        VALUE "Y". 01  WS-EOF              PIC X VALUE "N".     88  END-OF-FILE     VALUE "Y". 01  WS-LAST             PIC 9(4) COMP VALUE 0. 01  WS-PIPELINE         PIC S9(7)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 0. 01  WS-SHOWN            PIC ZZZ9. 01  WS-MONEY            PIC $$$,$$9.99. 01  WS-WORD             PIC X(9).* PROCEDURE DIVISION. MAIN-PARA.     PERFORM OPEN-FILE.     PERFORM COUNT-RECS.     PERFORM UNTIL ALL-DONE         PERFORM SHOW-MENU         PERFORM GET-CHOICE         EVALUATE WS-CHOICE             WHEN "1" PERFORM ADD-LEAD             WHEN "2" PERFORM LIST-ALL             WHEN "3" PERFORM FIND-ONE             WHEN "4" PERFORM MARK-SOLD             WHEN "5" PERFORM SHOW-PIPELINE             WHEN "9" MOVE "Y" TO WS-DONE         END-EVALUATE     END-PERFORM.     CLOSE LEAD-FILE.     STOP RUN.* OPEN-FILE.     OPEN I-O LEAD-FILE.     IF NOT STAT-OK         OPEN OUTPUT LEAD-FILE         CLOSE LEAD-FILE         OPEN I-O LEAD-FILE     END-IF.* COUNT-RECS.     MOVE "N" TO WS-EOF.     MOVE 0 TO WS-LAST.     MOVE 1 TO LEAD-KEY.     START LEAD-FILE KEY NOT LESS THAN LEAD-KEY         INVALID KEY MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF     END-START.     PERFORM UNTIL END-OF-FILE         READ LEAD-FILE NEXT RECORD             AT END MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF         END-READ         IF NOT END-OF-FILE             MOVE LEAD-KEY TO WS-LAST         END-IF     END-PERFORM.* SHOW-MENU.     DISPLAY " ".     DISPLAY "CONTACTS AND LEADS".     DISPLAY " ".     DISPLAY "1) ADD A CONTACT".     DISPLAY "2) LIST EVERYONE".     DISPLAY "3) FIND BY NUMBER".     DISPLAY "4) MARK ONE SOLD".     DISPLAY "5) OPEN PIPELINE".     DISPLAY "9) QUIT".     DISPLAY " ".* GET-CHOICE.     DISPLAY "CHOICE? ".     ACCEPT WS-CHOICE.* ADD-LEAD.     MOVE SPACE TO LEAD-REC.     MOVE 0 TO LR-VALUE.     DISPLAY "NAME?    ".     ACCEPT LR-NAME.     DISPLAY "COMPANY? ".     ACCEPT LR-COMPANY.     DISPLAY "PHONE?   ".     ACCEPT LR-PHONE.     DISPLAY "VALUE?   ".     ACCEPT LR-VALUE.     MOVE "L" TO LR-STATUS.     ADD 1 TO WS-LAST.     MOVE WS-LAST TO LEAD-KEY.     WRITE LEAD-REC         INVALID KEY DISPLAY "COULD NOT WRITE"     END-WRITE.* LIST-ALL.     MOVE "N" TO WS-EOF.     MOVE 1 TO LEAD-KEY.     START LEAD-FILE KEY NOT LESS THAN LEAD-KEY         INVALID KEY MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF     END-START.     PERFORM UNTIL END-OF-FILE         READ LEAD-FILE NEXT RECORD             AT END MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF         END-READ         IF NOT END-OF-FILE             PERFORM SHOW-REC         END-IF     END-PERFORM.* FIND-ONE.     DISPLAY "CONTACT NUMBER? ".     ACCEPT LEAD-KEY.     READ LEAD-FILE         INVALID KEY DISPLAY "NO SUCH CONTACT"     END-READ.     IF STAT-OK         PERFORM SHOW-REC     END-IF.* MARK-SOLD.     DISPLAY "CONTACT NUMBER? ".     ACCEPT LEAD-KEY.     READ LEAD-FILE         INVALID KEY DISPLAY "NO SUCH CONTACT"     END-READ.     IF STAT-OK         MOVE "S" TO LR-STATUS         REWRITE LEAD-REC             INVALID KEY DISPLAY "COULD NOT UPDATE"         END-REWRITE     END-IF.** Everything not yet sold, added up.  This is the* BCD pack doing the work: COMP-3 in, COMP-3 out,* no rounding surprises. SHOW-PIPELINE.     MOVE 0 TO WS-PIPELINE.     MOVE "N" TO WS-EOF.     MOVE 1 TO LEAD-KEY.     START LEAD-FILE KEY NOT LESS THAN LEAD-KEY         INVALID KEY MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF     END-START.     PERFORM UNTIL END-OF-FILE         READ LEAD-FILE NEXT RECORD             AT END MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF         END-READ         IF NOT END-OF-FILE AND NOT LS-SOLD             ADD LR-VALUE TO WS-PIPELINE         END-IF     END-PERFORM.     MOVE WS-PIPELINE TO WS-MONEY.     DISPLAY "OPEN PIPELINE: " WS-MONEY.* SHOW-REC.     MOVE LEAD-KEY TO WS-SHOWN.     MOVE LR-VALUE TO WS-MONEY.     EVALUATE TRUE         WHEN LS-SOLD     MOVE "SOLD" TO WS-WORD         WHEN LS-CALLED   MOVE "CONTACTED" TO WS-WORD         WHEN OTHER       MOVE "LEAD" TO WS-WORD     END-EVALUATE.     DISPLAY WS-SHOWN " " LR-NAME " " LR-PHONE.     DISPLAY "     " LR-COMPANY " " WS-WORD " " WS-MONEY.